  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">和</persName><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0001" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">王皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">蕣華</persName>琅邪臨沂人太尉<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>之孫也初為隨王妃中興元年為皇后<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0030" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">帝</persName>禪位后降為妃妃祖<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua-izumo:p001:m0039" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>自有傳</p>
